# Paths the founder must review before anything merges.
#
# These are the places where a change can disable the system's own safeguards, so
# they are never left to an automated approval. CODEOWNERS only has force once
# branch protection is enabled for the default branch with "Require review from
# Code Owners" turned on — until then this file documents intent but enforces
# nothing.

# The gate machinery. Both halves matter: the workflow calls gate-g2.sh, so write
# access to that script is write access to the gate itself.
/.github/                   @robinbanks000
/Studio/build/              @robinbanks000

# The constitution and the contracts that encode it.
/Studio/constitution/       @robinbanks000
/Studio/kernel/schemas/     @robinbanks000

# Unity project configuration, including the pinned editor version CI builds against.
/ProjectSettings/           @robinbanks000

# Anything touching money or player data.
/Assets/Monetization/       @robinbanks000
/Assets/Analytics/          @robinbanks000
